![Insights](Insights.png)

### Profit & Loss breakdown

![Profit](Profit.png)

---

## 💡 Key Findings

- The **Consumer** segment consistently drives the highest order volume across all years.
- **Technology** delivers the strongest profit margins despite lower order counts than Office Supplies.
- Several regions show high revenue but negative net profit — indicating fulfilment or returns issues worth investigating.
- A small cluster of products (~15% of SKUs) accounts for the majority of losses, suggesting a rationalisation opportunity.

